
## Prerequisites

- Node.js (v14 or later recommended)
- npm

## Getting Started

1. Install dependencies:

   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

2. Start the server:

   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

   The server runs on port `3000` by default. You can override it with the `PORT` environment variable:

   ```bash
   PORT=8080 npm start
   ```

3. Fetch all to-dos:

   ```bash
   curl http://localhost:3000/todos
   ```

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description                  |
| ------ | -------- | ---------------------------- |
| GET    | /todos   | Returns all to-dos as JSON   |
